WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.233
Welcome to Amazon.

00:00:01.233 --> 00:00:07.807
Whether you're a seasoned seller or just getting started, Amazon can help you take your business

00:00:07.807 --> 00:00:13.560
to the next level, putting your products in front of millions of shoppers worldwide.

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:20.072
You'll get access to time and money-saving programs like Fulfillment by Amazon, which can help you

00:00:20.072 --> 00:00:23.080
scale your business quickly and reach global customers.

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:29.552
Brand owners can take advantage of Amazon Brand Registry, a free program that provides your brand

00:00:29.552 --> 00:00:31.400
with additional benefits and protections.

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:38.514
Plus, take advantage of Amazon tools to help you advertise, boost sales, and discover new ways to

00:00:38.514 --> 00:00:38.880
grow.

00:00:39.060 --> 00:00:44.500
The first step to becoming an Amazon Seller is completing registration and setting up your selling

00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:44.840
account.

00:00:45.420 --> 00:00:50.431
To do this, you'll need to submit documents related to your identity and business if you have one,

00:00:50.431 --> 00:00:52.380
and wait for Amazon to verify them.

00:00:53.060 --> 00:00:56.302
We recommend reviewing our dedicated Amazon onboarding course

00:00:56.302 --> 00:01:01.975
for more information, which is available during your registration process in the Selling Basics

00:01:01.975 --> 00:01:02.380
tab.

00:01:03.260 --> 00:01:08.303
While you wait for your account to be verified, there are a few steps you can take to set yourself

00:01:08.303 --> 00:01:09.060
up for success.

00:01:09.860 --> 00:01:14.719
In order to list products on Amazon, you'll likely need a unique product ID or GTIN,

00:01:14.719 --> 00:01:18.060
and you can use this time to locate or obtain them.

00:01:18.060 --> 00:01:23.132
If you're the owner of an eligible brand, you should also consider enrolling it in brand registry

00:01:23.132 --> 00:01:24.000
while you wait.

00:01:24.480 --> 00:01:28.989
Once you've completed registration and your verification has been processed, you'll be able to sign

00:01:28.989 --> 00:01:30.191
into your selling account

00:01:30.191 --> 00:01:34.700
where you will manage most of your day-to-day business when selling with Amazon.

00:01:36.020 --> 00:01:43.014
If you have questions at any time, simply ask Seller Assistant, our AI chatbot, or explore Seller

00:01:43.014 --> 00:01:44.660
University for additional guidance.

00:01:45.600 --> 00:01:47.560
Once again, welcome  to Amazon.

00:01:47.880 --> 00:01:50.380
We're so excited to be a part of your selling journey.
